{"action": "read_text", "data": {"field_path": "details", "record_id": "GHSA-625g-gx8c-xcmg", "text": "The `contrib.auth.middleware.RemoteUserMiddleware` middleware in Django before 1.4.14, 1.5.x before 1.5.9, 1.6.x before 1.6.6, and 1.7 before release candidate 3, when using the `contrib.auth.backends.RemoteUserBackend` backend, allows remote authenticated users to hijack web sessions via vectors related to the `REMOTE_USER` header."}, "params": {"field_path": "details", "record_id": "GHSA-625g-gx8c-xcmg"}, "step": 2, "type": "observation"}
